# Model Evaluation & Refinement Projects

This repository contains hands-on projects focused on evaluating, improving, and optimizing machine learning regression models using Python and Scikit-learn.

## Topics Covered

* Train-Test Split
* Generalization Error
* Cross-Validation
* Polynomial Model Selection
* Underfitting and Overfitting Analysis
* Ridge Regression
* Hyperparameter Tuning
* Grid Search with `GridSearchCV`

## Technologies Used

* Python
* Pandas
* NumPy
* Matplotlib
* Scikit-learn
* Jupyter Notebook

## Key Learning Outcomes

* Split datasets into training and testing sets for model evaluation.
* Assessed model performance using generalization error and cross-validation.
* Selected the optimal polynomial degree by minimizing test error.
* Applied Ridge Regression to reduce overfitting and handle multicollinearity.
* Tuned the Ridge Regression hyperparameter (`alpha`) for improved performance.
* Optimized models using `GridSearchCV` to identify the best hyperparameters through cross-validation.
